# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# /logo/* is NOT a static file in this repo — images live in Cloudflare R2.
# This redirect makes https://nsengineering.com.np/logo/ns-logo.jpg resolve
# for OG images, schema.org markup, and any direct links.
#
# NSENGINEERING_R2_URL is a placeholder substituted at deploy time by the
# "Inject <env> R2 URL" step in deploy-dev.yml — each environment uses its
# own R2 bucket URL.

/logo/*  https://NSENGINEERING_R2_URL/logo/:splat  301
